Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:06.05,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll give birth to you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:09.86,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you'll never die this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:14.13,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you'll never \Nbe broken this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:17.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,By sharing my power with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:24.13,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Oh, but if I grant it to you all at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:26.43,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,you might not be able to endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:30.21,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So I'll make it so you're able to take it in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:32.93,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,little by little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:35.11,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,And to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:37.97,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll spread my seeds throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:43.98,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Someday your human body will eventually \Nbe able to accept that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:49.19,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Then you'll just need to absorb \Nthat power one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:54.10,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Once you've obtained all that power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.29,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,then you'll remember everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:01:02.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,and this time we'll be able \Nto be live together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.26,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki, I'm grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:53.40,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You truly were my wonderful friend \Nuntil the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.78,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:13.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kurumi Tokisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:15.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Also, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:20.67,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm able to stand before him \Nonce more thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:23.10,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:29.50,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.00,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,We finally meet again, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.34,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:11.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Have you remembered for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:13.55,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:16.40,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:24.14,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki's life signs have vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.16,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,It looks like she's completely dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:29.49,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Wh-What on earth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:32.16,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:42.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Please, reject my stupid thought \Nlike you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:46.98,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine, chastise me like you always do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:52.56,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Kotori, you really are a smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.82,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:05.57,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:07.94,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:10.38,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,You've been protecting Shin all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:12.08,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,and I'm truly grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:15.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine, who on earth are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:21.46,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm sure the answer isn't that far \Nfrom what you're already imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:25.22,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,That is me, and I am that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:28.06,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,We're one will in two bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:31.62,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,There was work I had to do on this end, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:34.75,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,So it was more convenient to split myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:39.10,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Especially when granting everyone Sephirah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:41.62,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Granting Sephirah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.61,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Then you're Phantom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:48.45,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Yes, and I am also the Spirit \Nof Origin Kurumi mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:53.07,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Kotori, the time I spent with you was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:55.66,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,But that's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.50,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.62,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:13.51,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Everyone, continue the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:17.54,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We've lost one ally and gained one enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.14,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:23.20,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh? You recovered quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.66,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm handling control of the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:28.65,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,so you could have remained \Ndepressed a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.65,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,If you're trying to light a fire under me, \Nthen do a better job of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:35.29,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,Pardon me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:39.67,Main,Maria,0,0,0,,It seems I still have room to learn about \Nthe intricacies of the human heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:46.32,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:48.29,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's all right, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:18.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:23.21,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin, have you remembered for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:26.21,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I've missed you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:29.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you for so, so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:33.50,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I've lived this long entirely for that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.45,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to share with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:43.34,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,There's so much \NI haven't been able to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.84,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ahh, but it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:50.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,This time, we'll be together forever, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:54.83,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm... happy to see you, too, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:55.99,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:08:00.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I left you alone for so long \Nand made you feel so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:04.63,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I truly am sorry I died before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:06.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.41,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's nothing for you to apologize for—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:08.00,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:16.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What on earth have you done \Nin order to revive me, Shinji Takamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.24,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Whatever it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:20.70,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I did anything I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:24.90,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I did everything I needed to in order \Nto see you one more time, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:34.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:39.64,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No... You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:43.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You can't sacrifice others, \Nno matter what your goal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:46.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:50.30,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,But then what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.01,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,You were the only one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:56.68,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,After losing you, \NI had no more reason to live, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:09:00.43,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,But I'm not weak like humans are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.89,0:09:03.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Even if I wanted to die, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:07.43,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm also not strong like humans are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:10.30,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I couldn't just forget about you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.82,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,So what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.67,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:20.66,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, that was mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:24.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,There's no way you could \Nanswer when I ask like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:26.64,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,But it's okay, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.25,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.66,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Time for the finishing touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:38.64,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I'll leave your memories as Shin \Nand erase all your other memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:42.47,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Then you'll be restored to Shin \Njust as I've been restored to Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.35,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything until now, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.35,0:09:49.10,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:54.40,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.32,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,We heard the story over the intercom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.24,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Is that really Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:02.85,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Alert. She's also the Spirit \Nof Origin and Phantom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.49,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,so she's being too greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:08.62,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.23,0:10:13.75,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Wait a little bit for me, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.01,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:18.01,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Where did you send Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.33,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:23.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That way he won't get caught up in our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yamabuki?! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:38.40,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,That's our line!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:41.08,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Itsuka, where did you come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.50,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Were you clinging to the ceiling \Nto go after Ai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:46.86,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Hey, is Tohka not enough for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:48.21,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.00,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Is this the spatial quake shelter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:54.13,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Why are you stating the obvious? \NNow move, you're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:54.91,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:56.71,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:58.71,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Which shelter is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.78,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.97,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,Obviously it's the one beneath the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:03.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The school...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:04.44,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:08.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's a pretty long distance \Nfrom where I previously was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sorry, everyone, but let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:12.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.61,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,You idiot! \NThe warning hasn't been lifted yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:19.27,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Where do you even plan on going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.41,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,To where Tohka and Origami are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:23.99,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.46,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:28.96,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,I haven't seen them in a while, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.78,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,I just thought they were \Nin a different shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:34.63,Main,Three,0,0,0,,Got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:37.75,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,H-Hey you four, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,T-Tonomachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yamabuki, Hazakura, Fujibakama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:44.42,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.54,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Those two are still stuck outside, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:49.29,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,You can thank us for today\Nwith lunch tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:50.64,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.15,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Give us a chance to look cool now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.98,Main - Top,Tama,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:56.86,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Sensei, this is a good moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.81,Main - Top,Tama,0,0,0,,What are you all doing, jeez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:59.28,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Go a little easier on me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:05.06,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,Hey! You can't do it, Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:08.66,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,The door won't open \Nuntil the warning is lifted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:13.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.79,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Lataib!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.90,Main,All,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.80,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:27.98,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.86,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You are Reine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:34.06,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:36.73,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Are you sure you won't reconsider?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.98,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,You've done a lot for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.94,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I'd rather not fight you if we don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:45.44,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:46.70,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.45,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:55.71,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,What are you doing ignoring us and \Nacting like the final battle is starting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.09,0:12:58.38,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Seriously, this is outlandish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.88,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein Sof Ohr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:09.07,Main,NibelcooleA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.14,Main,NibelcooleB,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:13.14,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.52,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,The Bandersnatch squad is wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.84,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole has vanished and can't reform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:43.18,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,Ship 3, Galdrabok, is unable \Nto maintain its Territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:43.96,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,It's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:54.60,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,So you've finally appeared, Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.31,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,My beloved Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:06.57,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I really do feel sorry toward all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.63,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's why I won't tell you not to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:14.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Because that's a natural right you all have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:17.73,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, come at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.88,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,my cute daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.76,Main,Yoshinon,0,0,0,,Here, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:39.77,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Origami, are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:42.98,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm, looks like your plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:47.64,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,You're the one who took out Artemisia, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:51.74,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,It surprised me when I saw a key suddenly \Nthrust in from out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.12,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.87,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,U-Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:01.41,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Seeing you this up close, \Nyou really are a normal girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:06.42,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Makes me wonder where they got that talk of \Nenemy lifeforms incapable of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:10.38,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,A bombardment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:11.51,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:18.02,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Defensive formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:25.15,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,You can't! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.21,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:35.83,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.04,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:40.54,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,What's going on? She's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:45.54,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,That should be where Master \Nand the others were fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.71,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.85,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Captain, please take care \Nof Mike and the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:52.22,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,If you take them to Fraxinus' medical facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.93,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,it might be possible to resuscitate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.43,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Fraxinus?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.50,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,The flagship currently fighting DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:01.06,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,We're going to aid Shido and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:08.97,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,What incredible magic capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:11.57,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Though your attacks are too direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:15.92,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I know you're happy \Nfor our long awaited reunion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:18.20,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,but settle down a bit, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:20.85,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I see you're still making \Nyourself look younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:24.96,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Well, not that I'm one to talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:25.79,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.16,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:32.50,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Why did you betray us, Elliot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:36.18,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,We had vowed to each other that \Nwe would get our retaliation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:39.85,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,our revenge, our retribution \Nagainst all of mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.45,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,You turned your back on our vows!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:49.24,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,You seduced my little sister, \Nstole the fruits of our research,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.21,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,and became our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:54.49,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Know that you will pay \Nfor that sin with your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:57.74,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I do feel bad for you and Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:01.75,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say I seduced Karen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:06.10,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,but before I knew it she had \Narranged her matters to be at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:11.23,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Regardless, I never wanted to be your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:16.13,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,It's just that the path I chose collided \Nwith the path you two chose in a weird way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:17.14,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:22.69,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I still haven't forgotten the resentment \NI feel for our village being burned down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.42,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,or the hatred I feel for our comrades' murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:26.33,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:30.71,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Have you noticed it, too, Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.53,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,This incredible spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:34.83,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:36.52,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:37.59,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:42.71,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,When I first saw that Spirit, I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:47.23,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,"Ahh, how pretty."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:55.93,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Then, "Is it okay to sacrifice such an \Ninnocent child for the sake of our revenge?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:18:00.18,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I thought, "If we do, then how \Nare we any different from the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.56,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,who burned down our home?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.59,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,You've always been pure and direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.47,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,The most so of all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:15.69,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,So I'm sure we're the two who changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:22.97,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,But I still consider you \Nand Ike to be my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.27,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,That will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:28.21,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,I'm sure Karen feels the same way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:29.71,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,What are you-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.62,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,If you can't forgive me, then that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.42,0:18:49.85,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,But at least give Karen another chance—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:50.94,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Chastiefol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:57.39,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Pierce him, Rhongomiant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:18:59.26,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Gungnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:22.47,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Kaguya, Yuzuru, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.68,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Wh-Who do you think you're talking to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.50,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:30.56,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Agreed. No matter how powerful our foe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:32.98,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,a Yamai will never back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.11,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:49.54,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Tohka, you won't be able \Nto defeat me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.75,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:56.34,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.30,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Yes! El Kanaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.31,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,A splendid surprise attack. However-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:11.22,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.77,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Halvanhelv!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.04,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Kaguya, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.67,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:44.75,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Ah? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:53.70,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,K-Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.37,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Yuzu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.33,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,K-Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:02.19,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Kaguya, Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:05.88,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.51,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Kaguya! Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:14.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Please let me make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:27.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:29.47,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's happening here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:43.74,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Now then, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:46.66,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Let's decide here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:52.15,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,which of us is fit \Nto obtain the Spirits' power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}Mother Mio
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs18\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 6 "The Three Magi"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:29.13,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,A cruel fate assails \Nthe young Westcott and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:33.64,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,However, a suspicious smile forms on his lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:36.72,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next episode is Episode 6: \NThe Three Magi.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:39.27,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is where it all began.
